B.aqn=new A.p4("WEATHER & AIR QUALITY","Place searches and forecast coordinates go to Open-Meteo. Search uses GeoNames data. Current air quality and UV come from CAMS through Open-Meteo; daily UV comes from the weather forecast. In the United States, displayed coordinates also go directly to the National Weather Service while Morrow is open to check active alerts.",null)
B.aqi=new A.p4("SEVERE WEATHER ALERTS","If you turn on push alerts, Morrow creates a pseudonymous installation identity in Supabase and stores the phone\u2019s APNs delivery token with National Weather Service zone codes. The notification service does not receive precise coordinates, place names, saved forecasts, or location history. Turning alerts off deletes the subscription.",null)
B.aql=new A.p4("ON THIS DEVICE","Saved places, display settings, and the latest forecasts stay on this device. The home-screen widget receives forecast values, never your coordinates.",null)
B.aqj=new A.p4("BACKGROUND REFRESH","The widget may refresh the selected forecast when your phone allows. It reuses saved coordinates and never reads device location in the background.",null)
B.aqk=new A.p4("TRACKING","Morrow has no profile, advertising tracker, or analytics SDK. The optional alert identity is used only to protect and remove that installation\u2019s push subscription.",null)
